  "body": "@GyanD Two reasons and different use cases:\n\n1. I need to decode frames based on integer index, in presentation order. In order to do so, I think I need to first query the index entries to get the pts of the n-th entry, seek to that pts, and decode (OR is there a way to seek to a specific dts/pos that I am not aware of?).\n\n2. I also need to count frames within a pts range. Without `AVIndexEntry` the only way is through demuxing which is slower.",
