  "body": "@GyanD wrote in https://code.ffmpeg.org/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/issues/23738#issuecomment-50248:\n\n> `av_seek_frame` has no notion of what the timestamp type is. It passes the arg to the MP4 demuxer in this case, which then interprets that arg as PTS and makes an adjustment to convert it to DTS so it can identify the entry in the stream index.\n\nIs there an API for dts-pts conversion? Why not allow `av_seek_frame` to take either pts or dts? Why not make `AVIndexEntry` contain both pts and dts? It appears that the backend can choose either pts or dts without users' discretion which really isn't ideal.",
